<title>USA: Seaton says 1996 to exceed estimates.</title>
<headline>Seaton says 1996 to exceed estimates.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seaton Group Inc said on Monday that annual earnings and revenues for 1996 should exceed earlier estimates.</p>
<p>The company said that estimated annual earnings/revenues for 1996 were as follows: 1996 EPS $.01 and 1996 Revenues $5,000,000.</p>
<p>Due to increased activity in the fiscal fourth quarter and the addition of a consumer electronic division, Seaton Group said it has an aggressive growth forecast for 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
